File name: DRESLOO2.MP
Path description: Black Fortress, including minor bosses.
Path starts: Dreary Village, Dreary Shop.
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Original Game
Level recommendation: 30-40
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: dark cultist, dark assassin, dark warrior, dark priest,
                      dark cleric, guard captain, elite guard, dark mage,
                      dark paladin, dark warlock, master assassin, alchemist,
                      dark wizard, dark bishop.
Additional information:

This loop includes the 4 minor bosses in the Black Fortress (alchemist, dark
wizard, dark bishop and master assassin). It also buys and sells a Kher Gras
at the end of every loop, which converts all the coins you are carrying
into the highest possible denominator (ie if you had 245g, you'd have 2p
and 45g after buying and selling a Kher Gras).
